        <p>The Strategic Communications Office identifies the information needs of the different offices of the academic community and develops appropriate communication strategies to meet those needs. It produces institutional information materials, establishes linkages with the mass media and formulates marketing strategies that create an accurate image of the University.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
