      </div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-content fade-in">
          <h3>Our Mission</h3>
          <p>The Strategic Communications Office serves as the primary hub for institutional communication at De La Salle University-Dasmariñas. We identify the diverse information needs of different offices within our academic community and develop comprehensive communication strategies to meet those needs effectively.</p>
          <p>Through innovative approaches and creative solutions, we produce high-quality institutional information materials, establish meaningful linkages with mass media, and formulate strategic marketing initiatives that accurately represent our University's values and achievements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-visual fade-in">
          <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
              <h4>Digital Excellence</h4>
