              <p>Producing visually stunning materials that reflect our institution's prestige</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
              <h4>Strategic Planning</h4>
              <p>Data-driven communication strategies for measurable impact</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
              <h4>Community Focus</h4>
              <p>Building stronger connections within our academic community</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
