  <section class="services-section" id="services">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="section-header fade-in">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Services</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Comprehensive communication solutions tailored to the needs of the institution</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card fade-in">
          <span class="service-number">01</span>
          <h3>Content Creation & Strategy</h3>
          <p>We develop compelling content strategies and create high-quality materials including brochures, newsletters, digital content, and multimedia presentations that effectively communicate the university's message to target audiences.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card fade-in">
          <span class="service-number">02</span>
          <h3>Media Relations & Outreach</h3>
          <p>Building and maintaining strong relationships with media outlets, managing press releases, coordinating interviews, and ensuring positive coverage of university events and achievements.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card fade-in">
          <span class="service-number">03</span>
          <h3>Digital Marketing & Social Media</h3>
          <p>Comprehensive digital marketing strategies including social media management, website content, online campaigns, and digital advertising to enhance the university's online presence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card fade-in">
          <span class="service-number">04</span>
          <h3>Brand Management & Design</h3>
          <p>Ensuring consistent brand representation across all communication materials, developing visual identity guidelines, and creating professional designs that uphold the university's image.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card fade-in">
          <span class="service-number">05</span>
          <h3>Event Communication</h3>
          <p>Complete communication support for university events including promotional materials, media coverage coordination, live event documentation, and post-event reporting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card fade-in">
          <span class="service-number">06</span>
          <h3>Crisis Communication</h3>
          <p>Strategic communication planning for sensitive situations, reputation management, and coordinated response strategies to maintain the university's positive image during challenging times.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

